{"version":1,"title":"DESIGN-LAB 全量再审计与后续成熟方案任务包","backing_conversation_id":"6ab08e75-182c-83e8-b275-548c400cbe92","widget_session_id":"8afe6b72-5b4b-4943-bc08-a381321669e3","widget_state":{"status":"completed","is_static_preview":true,"report_message":{"id":"7eea865c-70ac-4a2d-b6ea-c1a194e31b27","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{"real_author":"tool:web"}},"create_time":1789955853.946781,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["# DESIGN-LAB 全量再审计与后续成熟方案任务包\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n本轮重新以 GitHub 云端 `DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB` 为对象启动实时核验，**重新读取到的 `origin/main` 捕获基线为：**\n\n```text\n6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21\n```\n\n这说明本次对话前一轮审计所使用的：\n\n```text\ncb2163a2ad6db7bd12ee1ca07c1d3eb2badc328e\n```\n\n**已经不是当前主线。**\n\n因此，一个非常重要的结论是：前几轮报告中发现的缺陷不能不加验证地继续当作 `6c5f68e` 的现存缺陷；它们应转化为一组**必须在最新主线上重新执行的 invariant/regression tests**。本报告据此不把旧结论机械复制为“当前事实”，而将它们转换成可以直接执行、可以自动关闭、可以阻止回归的成熟化 TaskPack。\n\n本轮实时重新捕获了 `main@6c5f68e`；但在最终化前，没有完成对该 SHA 的 recursive tree 重新统计、Actions 日志展开、全部分支 compare 和 MiniMax Design 外部技术资料的第二轮完整抓取。因此，**下面凡是来自此前 `cb2163a2` 审计的数据均明确标成“上一已验证基线”，不得冒充 `6c5f68e` 当前事实。** 这也是成熟工程审计应有的证据纪律。\n\n截至上一完整审计基线 `cb2163a2`，DESIGN-LAB 已经不是纯文档或概念项目：它已有 Workbench、Python HTTP backend、SQLite state、Design Layer 合同、严格 TypeScript/Vite、CI、Design System catalog，以及本地浏览器受控运行能力；上一基线共有 **1,947 个文件、415 个目录、0 个 open PR、0 个 open Issue、0 个 GitHub Release；Canonical CI run `35390771963` 成功，Python suite 为 1,412 tests、7 skipped、0 fail。** 这些数字必须由本 TaskPack 的 `BASELINE-001` 在 `6c5f68e` 上重新生成，旧数字只保留作差异基线。〔仓库证据锚点：`AUTHORITY.md`、`.project/governance/authority-index.json`、`pyproject.toml`、`apps/workbench/**`、`src/design_lab/**`、`.github/workflows/**`、`reports/current/**`；上一审计 SHA `cb2163a2`〕\n\n综合三轮调研，DESIGN-LAB 目前真正需要解决的不是“再找更多能控制软件的方法”，而是把架构收敛成：\n\n> **Workbench → Canonical Backend → State/Intent → DesignIR/Domain Commands → Host Adapter → Photoshop/Illustrator/其他 Host → Readback → Evidence**\n\nMiniMax Design、UXP、JSX、CEP、Windows UI Automation、视觉自动化等都应该是 **Host Adapter / Capability Provider**，而不应该成为第二套产品、第二套状态机或第二个后端。\n\n尤其需要纠正一个认识：\n\n> **“MiniMax Design 看起来可以操作 Photoshop” ≠ “Adobe 全家桶已经有一套统一、稳定、可复用的程序接口”。**\n\nPhotoshop 被某个 Agent 操作成功，只能证明“某条控制路径对某个任务成立”。它可能通过宿主插件、脚本、UI 自动化、系统级 computer-use、私有桥接器或这些方式的组合实现。**在没有 MiniMax 官方公开接口合同、SDK、插件源码或仓库内调用链证据前，DESIGN-LAB 不应该把 MiniMax 当成 Adobe 的基础设施依赖。**\n\nMiniMax 最合理的定位是：\n\n```text\n可选外部执行 Provider\n        ↓\nDESIGN-LAB Host Adapter Contract\n        ↓\n统一 State / Readback / Evidence\n```\n\n而不是：\n\n```text\nDESIGN-LAB\n   ↓\nMiniMax Design\n   ↓\n所有软件\n```\n\n后者会把项目的可测试性、许可、版本、状态同步、可复现性、离线能力、Evidence provenance 全部绑定到一个外部产品。\n\n本报告给出的成熟路线因此是：\n\n```text\n先修正产品状态语义\n→ 真接 Reference\n→ 修 packaging\n→ exact-SHA browser E2\n→ 建统一 Host Adapter Protocol\n→ Photoshop 先做官方/可验证 E3\n→ Illustrator 第二\n→ MiniMax 作为 optional provider 接入\n→ 其他 Adobe/第三方软件按 capability 插件化\n→ Human E4\n→ Release E5\n```\n\n完成 P0 前，不应该继续横向扩充二十种软件 Adapter。\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    UI[Workbench] --> API[Canonical Backend]\n    API --> STATE[(Project State)]\n    API --> INTENT[Operation Intent]\n    INTENT --> DOMAIN[Design Domain / DesignIR]\n\n    DOMAIN --> ROUTER[Host Capability Router]\n\n    ROUTER --> PS[Photoshop Adapter]\n    ROUTER --> AI[Illustrator Adapter]\n    ROUTER --> MM[MiniMax Provider Adapter]\n    ROUTER --> UIA[Desktop UI Automation Adapter]\n\n    PS --> HOST1[Photoshop]\n    AI --> HOST2[Illustrator]\n    MM --> HOST3[External Agent / MiniMax]\n    UIA --> HOST4[Other Desktop App]\n\n    HOST1 --> READBACK[Canonical Readback]\n    HOST2 --> READBACK\n    HOST3 --> READBACK\n    HOST4 --> READBACK\n\n    READBACK --> STATE\n    READBACK --> EVIDENCE[Evidence Ledger E1-E5]\n```\n\n**当前保守产品标签：`CONTROLLED_RUNTIME_READY`。**\n\n在 `main@6c5f68e` 没有重新得到 exact-SHA 浏览器 E2、安装态 E2，以及真实 Adobe Host E3 之前，不能升级为 `PRODUCT_VERTICAL_SLICE_E2` 或 `REAL_HOST_WORKFLOW_E3`。\n\n## 实时基线、证据边界与仓库健康度\n\n### 当前可确认基线\n\n| 项目 | 本轮结果 | 证据等级/备注 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Repository | `DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB` | 实时 GitHub 仓库读取 |\n| 捕获到的 `origin/main` | `6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21` | **本轮重新读取** |\n| 上一完整审计 main | `cb2163a2ad6db7bd12ee1ca07c1d3eb2badc328e` | 历史比较基线 |\n| 本报告是否修改仓库 | 否 | 只读审计 |\n| Ending remote SHA | **未完成第二次 remote re-fetch** | 执行 TaskPack 时必须重新 fetch |\n| Current tree 完整计数 | **未在本轮最终化前重新计数** | 不用旧数字冒充 |\n| Current open PR/Issue | **需 BASELINE-001 重新查询** | 不沿用旧值 |\n| Current Release | **需 BASELINE-001 重新查询** | 不沿用旧值 |\n| Current latest CI run ID | **需 BASELINE-001 重新查询** | 不沿用旧 run |\n| Current tests/skip/fail | **需 exact-SHA CI 重新读取** | 不沿用旧 run |\n\n上一轮完整审计的数据只应用于趋势比较：\n\n| 指标 | 上一已验证基线 `cb2163a2` |\n|---|---:|\n| 文件 | 1,947 |\n| 目录 | 415 |\n| Open PR | 0 |\n| Open Issue | 0 |\n| Release | 0 |\n| 非 main 远端分支 | 30 |\n| Canonical CI run | `35390771963` |\n| Python tests | 1,412 |\n| skipped | 7 |\n| failed | 0 |\n\n这组数据最有价值的用途不是继续引用，而是让 `BASELINE-001` 输出类似：\n\n```text\nprevious_sha = cb2163...\ncurrent_sha  = 6c5f68...\n\nfiles:     1947 -> ?\ndirs:       415 -> ?\ntests:     1412 -> ?\nskip:         7 -> ?\nbranches:    30 -> ?\n```\n\n从而把仓库演进变成可审计事实。\n\n### 远端分支不能沿用旧分类\n\n上一完整审计得到的是：\n\n| 分类 | 上一数量 | 说明 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| Fully behind / absorbed | 8 | 可视为 cleanup candidate |\n| Pure ahead | 1 | 当时为 `docs/e-slice-session-summary-20260919` |\n| Diverged | 21 | 老基线残余，禁止 whole merge |\n\n但 `main` 已从 `cb2163a2` 前进到 `6c5f68e`，因此这张表**不能作为今天的分支事实表**。\n\n成熟做法是直接让 CI/审计脚本重新计算：\n\n```bash\ngit fetch --prune origin\n\ngit for-each-ref \\\n  --format='%(refname:short)' \\\n  refs/remotes/origin |\nwhile read ref; do\n  [ \"$ref\" = \"origin/main\" ] && continue\n\n  ahead=$(git rev-list --count origin/main..\"$ref\")\n  behind=$(git rev-list --count \"$ref\"..origin/main)\n\n  if [ \"$ahead\" -eq 0 ]; then\n    class=MERGED_OR_BEHIND\n  elif [ \"$behind\" -eq 0 ]; then\n    class=PURE_AHEAD\n  else\n    class=DIVERGED\n  fi\n\n  printf '%s\\t%s\\t%s\\t%s\\n' \"$ref\" \"$ahead\" \"$behind\" \"$class\"\ndone\n```\n\n并把结果生成：\n\n```text\n.project-local/audit/branch-matrix.tsv\n```\n\n而不是手工维护动态分支事实。\n\n### 本轮必须建立的“基线证据包”\n\n建议新增统一命令：\n\n```bash\npython scripts/audit/repository_baseline.py \\\n  --repo-root . \\\n  --output .project-local/audit/baseline.json\n```\n\n最低输出：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"subject_sha\": \"...\",\n  \"remote_main_sha\": \"...\",\n  \"clean\": true,\n  \"files\": 0,\n  \"directories\": 0,\n  \"open_prs\": 0,\n  \"open_issues\": 0,\n  \"releases\": 0,\n  \"branches\": {\n    \"merged_or_behind\": [],\n    \"ahead\": [],\n    \"diverged\": []\n  },\n  \"actions\": {\n    \"workflow_run_id\": null,\n    \"conclusion\": null\n  },\n  \"tests\": {\n    \"total\": null,\n    \"passed\": null,\n    \"failed\": null,\n    \"skipped\": null\n  }\n}\n```\n\n所有未来 `reports/current/**` 都从这个机器事实生成，不再靠人工把数字复制进 Markdown。\n\n## 核心发现：前端、后端、状态与证据链应该如何收敛\n\n以下“当前事实”分成两类：\n\n**A：结构性事实**——现有架构/文件所决定的问题，适合直接修。\n\n**B：上一基线发现**——必须在 `6c5f68e` 重新运行测试；如果已经修好，则关闭任务但保留 regression guard。\n\n### 产品纵切正确性\n\n| 维度 | 已知事实/需要复核 | 风险 | 成熟方案 | 必须增加的测试 | CI | 工程估算 |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|---|---:|\n| Direction single-choice | 上一基线 `choose_direction()` 存在同时多个 `chosen=1` 风险 | **P0** | DB transaction 内取消旧 chosen，再设置新 chosen；后端强制 invariant | A→B 连选，DB 最终只有 B | Python integration | 4–8h |\n| `chosen_direction` null | 上一基线无 choice 时可能 fallback 到最新 Direction | **P0** | 未真实选择必须返回 `null` | create direction without choose | Python + HTTP | 2–4h |\n| bind-before-choice | 上一基线 backend 只验证 direction existence | **P0** | backend fail-closed，要求 `chosen=1` | unchosen bind 无 DB row | Integration | 2–4h |\n| Brief.constraints | 上一基线 TS 为 string/null、backend 可能回 object | **P0** | canonical type 统一为 `string|null`，如需结构化另增 `constraint_spec` | nonempty roundtrip | Python + TS | 3–5h |\n| Reference validation | 上一切片 UI 固定/允许无真实 Reference | **P0** | asset existence + project ownership + dedupe + limit | missing/cross-project/valid | Integration + browser | 8–16h |\n| DesignSystem binding | catalog 已存在；绑定合法性需与 choice/version 对齐 | **P0** | 所有 binding 只针对 active chosen direction | unknown/unchosen/rebind | Integration | 4–8h |\n| Version/revision | 上一 schema 已有 version/supersession 字段，但链路未完整 | **P1** | append-only revision/event lineage | v1→v2→v3 history | Integration | 16–24h |\n\n建议把最重要的 state invariants 从应用代码提升成显式合同：\n\n```text\nINV-DL-001  每个 Brief 最多一个 active chosen Direction\nINV-DL-002  chosen_direction 必须对应 persisted chosen=true\nINV-DL-003  未 chosen 的 Direction 不得产生 active DesignSystem binding\nINV-DL-004  Reference 必须存在且属于同 Project\nINV-DL-005  active binding 必须引用 active Direction revision\nINV-DL-006  OperationIntent replay 不得改变最终状态\n```\n\n对这些 invariant，**HTTP 200/400 不是验收证据**。\n\n验收必须查数据库最终状态。例如：\n\n```python\ndef test_switch_direction_leaves_exactly_one_chosen(api, db):\n    brief = create_brief(api)\n    a = create_direction(api, brief)\n    b = create_direction(api, brief)\n\n    choose(api, a)\n    choose(api, b)\n\n    rows = db.execute(\n        \"\"\"\n        SELECT id, chosen\n        FROM directions\n        WHERE brief_id = ?\n        ORDER BY id\n        \"\"\",\n        (brief.id,),\n    ).fetchall()\n\n    chosen = [row[\"id\"] for row in rows if row[\"chosen\"] == 1]\n\n    assert chosen == [b.id]\n\n    state = api.get_design_layer()\n    assert state[\"chosen_direction\"][\"id\"] == b.id\n```\n\n对 `bind-before-choice`：\n\n```python\nresponse = api.bind_design_system(direction_id=d.id, system_id=system.id)\nassert response.status_code in (400, 409, 422)\n\nassert db.execute(\n    \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM design_system_bindings WHERE direction_id = ?\",\n    (d.id,),\n).fetchone()[0] == 0\n```\n\n这比“接口返回了错误码”强得多，因为它能防止“HTTP 报错但 transaction 已经写了一半”。\n\n### Reference 应真正成为产品节点\n\n成熟的产品链应该是：\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User\n    participant W as Workbench\n    participant A as Backend\n    participant DB as SQLite\n    participant AS as Asset Store\n\n    U->>W: Import reference\n    W->>A: POST asset\n    A->>AS: Persist bytes/metadata\n    A->>DB: Persist project ownership\n\n    U->>W: Select reference\n    W->>A: Create Brief(reference_asset_ids)\n    A->>DB: Validate asset exists\n    A->>DB: Validate same project\n    A->>DB: Persist Brief\n\n    U->>W: Create Directions\n    W->>A: POST directions\n    U->>W: Choose Direction\n    W->>A: choose\n    A->>DB: Atomic single choice\n\n    U->>W: Bind Design System\n    W->>A: bind\n    A->>DB: Validate chosen\n    A->>DB: Persist binding\n```\n\n建议 API 错误稳定化：\n\n```text\nREFERENCE_ASSET_NOT_FOUND\nREFERENCE_ASSET_PROJECT_MISMATCH\nDIRECTION_NOT_FOUND\nDIRECTION_NOT_CHOSEN\nDESIGN_SYSTEM_NOT_FOUND\nREVISION_CONFLICT\nOPERATION_INTENT_CONFLICT\n```\n\n前端不应重新实现这些规则。\n\nWorkbench 只负责：\n\n- 呈现候选；\n- 发出 intent；\n- 显示 backend 的 canonical result；\n- 显示明确错误。\n\n**真值在 backend/state，不在 React/TypeScript/DOM。**\n\n### Versioning 不应继续只是 schema decoration\n\n推荐把 revision 模型统一成：\n\n```text\nStable identity\n    brief_id\n        │\n        ├── revision 1\n        ├── revision 2\n        └── revision 3 ← active\n\nDirection stable identity\n        │\n        ├── revision 1\n        └── revision 2 ← active\n```\n\n比起允许任意 UPDATE，更成熟的是：\n\n```text\nappend new revision\n+\nsupersession event/link\n+\nactive projection\n```\n\n如果现有 DB 追求 append-only，则不要为了 `superseded_by` 去修改历史业务 row，可以建立：\n\n```sql\nrevision_links(\n    entity_kind TEXT NOT NULL,\n    predecessor_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    successor_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n    created_at TEXT NOT NULL,\n    operation_intent_id TEXT NOT NULL\n)\n```\n\n或者把 supersession 本身作为 event。\n\n这样同时得到：\n\n- 可审计；\n- 可 rollback；\n- 可重放；\n- 可做 Evidence；\n- 可做 Host patch provenance。\n\n### 前端成熟方案\n\nWorkbench 不需要大重写。\n\n建议保持现有 TypeScript/Vite 路线，只收敛成五层：\n\n```text\nApp shell\n  ↓\nFeature UI\n  ↓\nTyped API client\n  ↓\nCanonical state projection\n  ↓\nBackend\n```\n\n前端重点补：\n\n| 项目 | 优先级 |\n|---|---:|\n| Reference asset picker | P0 |\n| Direction chosen 状态明确显示 | P0 |\n| bind-before-choice disabled + backend error handling | P0 |\n| Loading/error/retry state | P0 |\n| API schema runtime validation | P1 |\n| operation_intent visibility/debug panel | P1 |\n| revision history UI | P1 |\n| Host status/capability panel | P1 |\n| Host execution progress/readback | P1 |\n\n不要让 Workbench 直接知道：\n\n```text\nPhotoshop JSX command\nIllustrator action name\nMiniMax prompt\nWindows UIAutomation selector\n```\n\n这些都属于 adapter。\n\nWorkbench 应该只发送：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"operation\": \"apply_design\",\n  \"project_id\": \"...\",\n  \"design_revision_id\": \"...\",\n  \"target\": {\n    \"capability\": \"raster_layered_edit\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 软件控制层：MiniMax Design、Adobe 与开源 Adapter 的成熟方案\n\n### 先回答核心问题\n\n**不是“只要 MiniMax Design 能操作 Photoshop，Adobe 全家桶就自然全部可以操控”。**\n\n真正需要区分五类能力：\n\n| 类型 | 含义 | 可靠性 | 是否适合作 DESIGN-LAB 主路径 |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| Native API / DOM | 宿主提供结构化 API | 高 | **是** |\n| UXP/官方插件 | 宿主内插件执行命令并读状态 | 高 | **是** |\n| JSX/ExtendScript/宿主脚本 | 传统自动化接口 | 中高 | **适合作兼容路径** |\n| OS accessibility/UI automation | 点菜单、控件、窗口 | 中 | fallback |\n| Vision/computer-use | 看屏幕、点击、键盘 | 中低 | last-mile fallback |\n\n同样一个“生成海报”的演示，肉眼看都像“AI 控制 Photoshop”，但工程性质完全不同。\n\nDESIGN-LAB 的核心目标不是证明“鼠标可以自动点 Photoshop”，而是保证：\n\n```text\nCommand\n→ deterministic intent\n→ host execution\n→ artifact\n→ structured readback\n→ state update\n→ evidence\n→ rollback/retry\n```\n\n### MiniMax Design 应如何定位\n\n本轮没有取得足以把 MiniMax Design 的 Photoshop 内部控制方式确定为 **UXP、CEP、JSX、remote host 或其他特定机制**的公开源码/接口证据，因此不能凭 UI 演示给它下技术结论。\n\n在取得以下任一实证前：\n\n- 官方 SDK；\n- 官方 Photoshop plugin；\n- UXP/CEP manifest；\n- JSX bundle；\n- 本地 daemon protocol；\n- documented API；\n- 仓库内实际调用 MiniMax 的 adapter/client；\n- network/IPC contract；\n\n应把状态写为：\n\n```text\nMINIMAX_PHOTOSHOP_CONTROL_MECHANISM = UNVERIFIED\n```\n\n而不是猜成：\n\n```text\nUXP\n```\n\n或：\n\n```text\nJSX\n```\n\n同理，**仓库里出现 MiniMax 的名称、调研文档、可执行文件路径、软件清单或配置项，都不能自动证明 MiniMax 是 DESIGN-LAB 的内部组件。**\n\n判断标准应该是：\n\n```text\n有没有源码？\n有没有 vendored package？\n有没有 SDK dependency？\n有没有 API client？\n有没有 adapter implementation？\n有没有 license/provenance？\n有没有 CI？\n有没有 exact-SHA runtime evidence？\n```\n\n只要答案主要是否，MiniMax 就是：\n\n> **External Capability Provider**\n\n而不是：\n\n> **Repository Component**\n\n### 不应设计 `MiniMax → Adobe everything`\n\n更成熟的是：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    DL[DESIGN-LAB Core]\n    CAP[Capability Router]\n\n    DL --> CAP\n\n    CAP --> PSD[Photoshop Native Adapter]\n    CAP --> AID[Illustrator Native Adapter]\n    CAP --> MM[MiniMax External Adapter]\n    CAP --> UIA[Desktop Automation Adapter]\n\n    PSD --> PS[Photoshop]\n    AID --> AI[Illustrator]\n\n    MM -. provider may control .-> PS\n    MM -. provider may control .-> AI\n    MM -. provider may control .-> OTHER[Other software]\n\n    UIA -. fallback .-> PS\n    UIA -. fallback .-> AI\n    UIA -. fallback .-> OTHER\n```\n\n例如一个任务：\n\n```text\ncapability = raster.layer.create\n```\n\nRouter 可以选择：\n\n```text\nphotoshop_uxp\n```\n\n另一个高层任务：\n\n```text\ncapability = creative.agentic_edit\n```\n\n如果 MiniMax 经验证支持，就可以选择：\n\n```text\nminimax_external\n```\n\n但无论走哪条路，最终都必须回到：\n\n```text\nCanonical Readback\n```\n\n### Adobe 不要做一个巨大的“全家桶 Adapter”\n\n应该做 Capability Matrix。\n\n建议至少按：\n\n| Host | DESIGN-LAB 典型价值 | 首选控制策略 | GUI fallback | 建议阶段 |\n|---|---|---|---|---:|\n| Photoshop | bitmap、layer、mask、PSD | 官方宿主 API/插件/脚本 | UIA/vision | **第一优先** |\n| Illustrator | vector、path、AI/SVG | 官方脚本/插件接口 | UIA | **第二优先** |\n| InDesign | 排版、多页、印刷 | 文档/脚本接口 | UIA | P2 |\n| After Effects | motion/composition | host scripting/plugin | UIA | P2 |\n| Premiere Pro | timeline/video | host-specific integration | UIA | P2 |\n| Acrobat | PDF preflight/output | PDF/API/CLI workflow | GUI fallback | P1/P2 |\n| Lightroom | photography workflow | 取决于公开插件/API边界 | GUI fallback | P2 |\n\n这里的关键不是“理论上可不可以点”。\n\n而是每个 Host 必须回答：\n\n```text\nCan execute?\nCan read back?\nCan identify document?\nCan identify exact object/layer?\nCan detect failure?\nCan retry idempotently?\nCan emit editable artifact?\nCan prove which application/version produced it?\n```\n\n只有都能回答，才有资格进入 E3 路径。\n\n### 第三方开源自动化方案\n\n以下更适合作为 **fallback adapter primitives**，不是 canonical design backend：\n\n| 方案 | 主要能力 | 常见许可证* | 集成工作量 | 风险 | 推荐定位 |\n|---|---|---|---:|---:|---|\n| pywinauto | Windows Win32/UI Automation | BSD 系 | 低–中 | 中 | Windows native fallback |\n| FlaUI | .NET UIA2/UIA3 | MIT 系 | 中 | 中 | Windows rich UI fallback |\n| PyAutoGUI | mouse/keyboard/screenshot | BSD 系 | 低 | 高 | emergency fallback |\n| SikuliX | visual matching + GUI automation | 版本需锁定复核 | 中 | 高 | vision fallback |\n| Robot Framework | automation orchestration | Apache 系 | 中 | 中 | test/orchestration |\n| AutoHotkey | Windows keyboard/window automation | GPL 系 | 低 | 中高 | local operator helper |\n\n\\*正式进入仓库前必须由 `SUPPLY-CHAIN-*` 任务对**实际锁定版本**重新读取 LICENSE/SPDX，不能仅凭项目历史许可证记忆作合规决策。\n\n选择原则：\n\n```text\nNative host API\n    >\nOfficial plugin/scripting\n    >\nStructured OS automation\n    >\nVisual automation\n    >\nRaw coordinate clicking\n```\n\n不要反过来。\n\n### 推荐统一 Host Adapter Contract\n\n可以新增类似：\n\n```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import Protocol, Any\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass HostCapability:\n    name: str\n    readback: bool\n    editable_artifact: bool\n    deterministic_targeting: bool\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass ExecutionReceipt:\n    operation_id: str\n    host: str\n    host_version: str\n    document_id: str | None\n    artifact_uri: str | None\n    readback: dict[str, Any]\n    provider: str\n    success: bool\n\n\nclass HostAdapter(Protocol):\n    def probe(self) -> list[HostCapability]:\n        ...\n\n    def execute(\n        self,\n        operation: dict[str, Any],\n    ) -> ExecutionReceipt:\n        ...\n\n    def readback(\n        self,\n        document_id: str,\n    ) -> dict[str, Any]:\n        ...\n```\n\n然后：\n\n```text\nPhotoshopAdapter\nIllustratorAdapter\nMiniMaxProviderAdapter\nWindowsUIAutomationAdapter\n```\n\n都遵循同一接口。\n\n这会彻底解决“找到这么多控制方式为什么项目还是慢”的根因：\n\n> 之前找的是很多**控制技术**；成熟系统真正缺的是一个让这些控制技术可以被替换、验证、回读和比较的**统一执行合同**。\n\n## Packaging、Browser E2E 与 Evidence 必须一次补正确\n\n### Wheel 不能依赖 Git checkout 路径\n\n上一基线的一个重要 packaging 风险是：\n\n`design_layer.py` 的 Design System catalog 从 repository 路径读取，而 wheel 配置并未明确保证 `design-lab/design-systems/**` 被安装。\n\n成熟方案不是继续增加相对路径 fallback，而是把 runtime 必须资源变成 package resources。\n\n建议迁移：\n\n```text\nsrc/\n└── design_lab/\n    └── resources/\n        └── design_systems/\n            ├── ...\n            │   └── manifest.json\n            └── ...\n```\n\n然后：\n\n```python\nfrom importlib.resources import files\nimport json\n\n\ndef load_design_system_manifest(system_id: str) -> dict:\n    path = (\n        files(\"design_lab.resources.design_systems\")\n        .joinpath(system_id)\n        .joinpath(\"manifest.json\")\n    )\n\n    if not path.is_file():\n        raise KeyError(f\"Unknown design system: {system_id}\")\n\n    return json.loads(path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n```\n\n避免：\n\n```python\nPath(__file__).parents[...] / \"design-lab\" / \"design-systems\"\n```\n\n运行时资源应该属于 wheel，而不是属于 Git repository layout。\n\n`pyproject.toml` 应明确 include/package：\n\n```toml\n# 示意；最终语法依仓库当前 build backend 调整\n[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel]\npackages = [\"src/design_lab\"]\n\n[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel.force-include]\n\"src/design_lab/resources/design_systems\" = \"design_lab/resources/design_systems\"\n```\n\n### Installed-wheel smoke 必须脱离仓库目录\n\n这是关键：\n\n```bash\npython -m build --wheel\n\npython -m venv .project-local/wheel-smoke\n.project-local/wheel-smoke/bin/python -m pip install dist/*.whl\n\ncd .project-local/empty-cwd\n\n../wheel-smoke/bin/python -I \\\n  -m design_lab.smoke.design_layer\n```\n\nWindows：\n\n```powershell\npython -m venv .project-local\\wheel-smoke\n.project-local\\wheel-smoke\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install dist\\*.whl\n\nSet-Location .project-local\\empty-cwd\n..\\wheel-smoke\\Scripts\\python.exe -I -m design_lab.smoke.design_layer\n```\n\nSmoke 必须真正完成：\n\n```text\nload catalog\n→ create project\n→ create real/reference asset\n→ create brief\n→ create directions\n→ choose\n→ bind DesignSystem\n→ read state\n→ assert DB\n```\n\n以及检查 wheel inventory：\n\n```bash\npython -m zipfile -l dist/*.whl\n```\n\n禁止出现：\n\n```text\n.project-local/\n.git/\ncredentials\nnode_modules/\nbrowser cache\nruntime databases\noperator artifacts\n```\n\n### Browser E2E 必须从“能跑”升级到“必须跑”\n\n上一完整审计最关键的问题之一是：\n\n> 浏览器测试存在，但在干净 GitHub runner 缺 browser/cache 时可以 skip。\n\n这意味着：\n\n```text\ntest file exists\n```\n\n不等于：\n\n```text\nexact SHA browser evidence exists\n```\n\n推荐新增独立：\n\n```text\nworkbench-browser-e2e\n```\n\njob。\n\n核心原则：\n\n```text\nbrowser unavailable == CI failure\n```\n\n而不是：\n\n```text\nbrowser unavailable == pytest skip == green\n```\n\n示例 workflow：\n\n```yaml\nname: Design Lab Browser E2E\n\non:\n  pull_request:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  workbench-browser-e2e:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 20\n\n    env:\n      DESIGN_LAB_REQUIRE_BROWSER_E2E: \"1\"\n      CI: \"true\"\n\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout exact commit\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n\n      - name: Python\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n        with:\n          python-version: \"3.12\"\n\n      - name: Node\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version-file: \".nvmrc\"\n          cache: \"pnpm\"\n\n      - name: Enable package manager\n        run: corepack enable\n\n      - name: Install Python dependencies\n        run: uv sync --locked\n\n      - name: Install JS dependencies\n        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n\n      - name: Build Workbench\n        run: pnpm --filter workbench build\n\n      - name: Install locked Chromium runtime\n        run: pnpm exec playwright install --with-deps chromium\n\n      - name: Run browser E2E\n        run: pnpm e2e:ci\n\n      - name: Assert browser test did not skip\n        run: python scripts/ci/assert_e2e_result.py .project-local/e2e/result.json\n\n      - name: Upload failure artifacts\n        if: failure()\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: workbench-browser-e2e-${{ github.sha }}\n          path: |\n            .project-local/e2e/\n```\n\n正式 PR 中最好把 GitHub Actions 本身也改为组织认可的 immutable commit SHA；上面使用 major tag 是为了展示结构。\n\nPlaywright 版本不要 workflow 里再“拿最新版”。\n\n版本真值应该来自：\n\n```text\npnpm-lock.yaml\n```\n\n因此：\n\n```bash\npnpm exec playwright install chromium\n```\n\n安装的是锁文件对应的 runtime。\n\n### 浏览器 E2E 的最小用户旅程\n\n不能只测试页面打开：\n\n```text\nopen Workbench\n→ create project\n→ import PNG\n→ select PNG as Reference\n→ create Brief with non-empty constraints\n→ create Direction A\n→ create Direction B\n→ choose A\n→ choose B\n→ assert UI only B chosen\n→ bind Design System\n→ reload\n→ assert persisted state\n→ query backend/readback\n→ query SQLite\n→ assert exactly one chosen\n→ assert reference ownership\n→ assert one active binding\n```\n\n同时：\n\n```text\nconsole.error == 0\npageerror == 0\nunexpected request failure == 0\nskip == 0\n```\n\n### Evidence requalification 要从 metadata 变成 Gate semantics\n\n如果旧证据：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"actualEvidence\": \"E3\",\n  \"requiresRequalification\": true\n}\n```\n\nRelease verifier 不应该仍然认为：\n\n```text\neffectiveEvidence = E3\n```\n\n成熟规则：\n\n```python\ndef effective_evidence(record, current_sha):\n    if record.requires_requalification:\n        return record.current_tree_verified_level\n\n    if not evidence_applies_to_tree(record, current_sha):\n        return record.current_tree_verified_level\n\n    return record.actual_evidence\n```\n\n例如：\n\n```text\n历史 Photoshop E3\n+\n当前 main 只重新验证 structural contracts E1\n\n=> current release effective level = E1\n```\n\n但旧 E3 不能删除，它仍然是历史证据：\n\n```text\nhistoricalEvidence = E3\ncurrentEffectiveEvidence = E1\n```\n\n这个区别对于成熟的 Evidence system 极其重要。\n\n建议统一：\n\n| 等级 | 必须证明 |\n|---|---|\n| E0 | 声明/计划存在 |\n| E1 | 代码、合同、静态结构存在 |\n| E2 | 当前 SHA 受控 runtime 成功 |\n| E3 | 当前/适用树上真实外部 Host 工作流成功 |\n| E4 | 独立人类验收 |\n| E5 | 发布、安装、重现成功 |\n\n## 可直接执行的 Final Maturity TaskPack\n\n下面这张表可以直接转 GitHub Issues/PR batches。\n\n| TASK ID | 描述 | 主要文件/区域 | Tests | CI changes | 工程估算 | Priority | Owner |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---:|---:|---|\n| `BASELINE-001` | 重新捕获 `6c5f68e` 之后的 live main 全事实 | `scripts/audit/**`, `.project-local/audit/**` | baseline schema test | baseline artifact | 4–6h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `BASELINE-002` | 自动生成 branch merged/ahead/diverged matrix | audit scripts | temporary branch graph tests | audit job | 3–5h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-STATE-001` | Direction single-choice invariant | state/design layer | A→B、B→A、replay | Python gate | 4–8h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-STATE-002` | no-choice → `chosen_direction=null` | backend/read model | empty choice | Python gate | 2–4h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-STATE-003` | unchosen direction bind rejection | backend/state | no DB mutation | Python gate | 2–4h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-BRIEF-001` | constraints contract 统一 | TS contract + backend | nonempty roundtrip | TS + Python | 3–5h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-REF-001` | Reference existence validation | assets/design layer | nonexistent | Python | 4–6h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-REF-002` | Reference project ownership | assets/state | cross-project rejection | Python | 4–6h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-REF-003` | Workbench Reference picker | `apps/workbench/**` | component + E2E | browser | 8–12h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `DL-BIND-001` | DesignSystem binding invariant | design layer/state | unknown/unchosen/idempotent | Python | 4–8h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `PKG-001` | DesignSystem 迁入 package resources | `src/design_lab/resources/**`, `pyproject.toml` | resource load | wheel job | 6–10h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `PKG-002` | isolated installed-wheel E-slice | smoke scripts | isolated `-I` | wheel-smoke | 6–8h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `E2E-001` | clean-runner Playwright/Chromium | Workbench tests/workflow | full vertical slice | dedicated job | 8–12h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `E2E-002` | no-skip browser policy | test harness | browser missing must fail | assert result | 3–5h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `E2E-003` | UI + backend + SQLite triple readback | E2E/readback | persistence assertions | browser job | 6–10h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `GOV-001` | Authority remaining-work drift | `AUTHORITY.md` | authority verifier | governance gate | 2–4h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `GOV-002` | authority-index current drift cleanup | `authority-index.json` | schema/semantic | governance gate | 2–3h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `GOV-003` | LANGUAGE-POLICY 与 Node/TS 事实同步 | policy | policy contract | governance gate | 2–3h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `GOV-004` | `reports/current` freshness semantics | reports generator | stale subject test | projection gate | 4–6h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `EVID-001` | requalification affects effective floor | evidence verifier | stale E3 test | release gate | 4–8h | **P0** | TBD |\n| `REV-001` | Brief revision model | schema/service | v1→v2 | Python | 8–12h | P1 | TBD |\n| `REV-002` | Direction revision model | schema/service | choice across revisions | Python | 8–12h | P1 | TBD |\n| `REV-003` | Binding supersession lineage | schema/service | rebind history | Python | 8–12h | P1 | TBD |\n| `HOST-001` | canonical Host Adapter Protocol | `src/design_lab/host/**` | contract tests | Python | 8–16h | P1 | TBD |\n| `HOST-002` | capability probe/router | host/runtime | fake adapters | Python | 8–12h | P1 | TBD |\n| `PS-001` | Photoshop official-path adapter requalification | Photoshop adapter | fake + controlled host | E3 manual/host job | 16–32h | P1 | TBD |\n| `PS-002` | Photoshop readback/receipt/provenance | Photoshop adapter | artifact/layer readback | host evidence | 12–20h | P1 | TBD |\n| `AI-001` | Illustrator adapter 对齐同一 contract | Illustrator adapter | controlled host | host evidence | 16–32h | P1 | TBD |\n| `MM-001` | MiniMax provenance/API/mechanism qualification | integrations/minimax | adapter contract | optional provider gate | 8–16h | P1 | TBD |\n| `MM-002` | MiniMaxProviderAdapter（仅在接口可合法复用时） | host provider | fake + real provider | optional E3 | 12–24h | P1 | TBD |\n| `UIA-001` | Windows structured UI fallback | host/windows | isolated target fixture | Windows job | 16–24h | P2 | TBD |\n| `SUPPLY-001` | OSS adapter license/version qualification | deps/governance | SPDX check | license gate | 6–10h | P1 | TBD |\n| `HUMAN-001` | Human Jury evidence execution | evidence/jury | rubric | E4 gate | 8–16h | P1 | TBD |\n| `REL-001` | install/release/repeatability | release | clean-machine smoke | release gate | 12–20h | P1 | TBD |\n\n### 推荐 PR 批次\n\n不要一口气做成一个 100 文件 PR。\n\n**PR A — Baseline + State Correctness**\n\n```text\nBASELINE-001\nBASELINE-002\nDL-STATE-001\nDL-STATE-002\nDL-STATE-003\nDL-BRIEF-001\n```\n\n**PR B — Real Reference**\n\n```text\nDL-REF-001\nDL-REF-002\nDL-REF-003\nDL-BIND-001\n```\n\n**PR C — Packaging Truth**\n\n```text\nPKG-001\nPKG-002\n```\n\n**PR D — Exact-SHA Browser E2**\n\n```text\nE2E-001\nE2E-002\nE2E-003\n```\n\n达到这里以后才能给当前纵切标：\n\n```text\nPRODUCT_VERTICAL_SLICE_E2\n```\n\n**PR E — Governance/Evidence Convergence**\n\n```text\nGOV-001..004\nEVID-001\n```\n\n**PR F — Revision**\n\n```text\nREV-001..003\n```\n\n**PR G — Host Control Architecture**\n\n```text\nHOST-001\nHOST-002\n```\n\n**PR H — Photoshop E3**\n\n```text\nPS-001\nPS-002\n```\n\n只有这个 PR 在真实 Photoshop 上产生当前适用 Evidence，才允许：\n\n```text\nREAL_HOST_WORKFLOW_E3\n```\n\n之后：\n\n```text\nIllustrator\n→ MiniMax optional provider\n→ other software\n```\n\n而不是同时展开。\n\n### 建议执行时间线\n\n```mermaid\ngantt\n    title DESIGN-LAB Maturity Convergence\n    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD\n    axisFormat  %m-%d\n\n    section Correctness\n    Baseline and invariants        :a1, 2026-09-22, 4d\n    Reference integration          :a2, after a1, 5d\n\n    section Runtime\n    Wheel/install truth            :b1, after a2, 3d\n    Exact-SHA Browser E2           :b2, after b1, 4d\n\n    section Governance\n    Authority/report convergence   :c1, after b2, 3d\n    Evidence requalification       :c2, after c1, 2d\n\n    section State maturity\n    Revision/supersession          :d1, after c2, 5d\n\n    section Host\n    Host Adapter Protocol          :e1, after d1, 5d\n    Photoshop E3                   :e2, after e1, 7d\n    Illustrator E3                 :e3, after e2, 7d\n\n    section Providers\n    MiniMax qualification          :f1, after e1, 4d\n    Other host adapters            :f2, after e3, 7d\n\n    section Acceptance\n    Human E4                       :g1, after e3, 5d\n    Release E5                     :g2, after g1, 5d\n```\n\n这是工程排程模型，不是要求日历必须机械照此执行；真正前后关系以 Gate 为准。\n\n## Governance、Commit 规则与验收命令\n\n### Authority 最小变更原则\n\n不要再新建第二份 Authority。\n\n`AUTHORITY.md` 只需要更新：\n\n```text\ncurrent implemented baseline\nremaining work\nevidence status\n```\n\n不要把瞬时数字——例如：\n\n```text\n当前有 31 个 branch\n当前 tests=1412\n```\n\n长期写入 Authority。\n\n这些应该属于 machine-generated baseline/report。\n\nAuthority 应保存稳定合同：\n\n```text\nDESIGN-LAB has one canonical runtime\nDESIGN-LAB has one canonical state authority\nHost providers cannot own canonical project state\nE3 requires real-host execution and readback\n...\n```\n\n### `authority-index.json`\n\n建议让 CI 自动检查：\n\n```text\nindex claimed current\nAND\nsubject SHA compatibility\nAND\nreferenced document exists\nAND\nauthority status not stale\n```\n\n已经完成收敛的 `AGENTS.md` 不应该永久挂在：\n\n```text\ncurrentButDrifted\n```\n\n### `LANGUAGE-POLICY`\n\n它应该描述：\n\n```text\nPython = canonical backend/runtime\nTypeScript = Workbench UI\nNode = frontend build/test toolchain\npnpm = single workspace/package manager\nVite = Workbench build\n```\n\n而不是继续保留已经不符合代码事实的：\n\n```text\nno root package.json\nno lockfile\nno product Node build\n```\n\n前提是 `BASELINE-001` 在当前 main 确认这些文件仍然存在。\n\n### `reports/current`\n\n建议直接引入 manifest：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"report_kind\": \"LAST_GENERATED_PROJECTION\",\n  \"subject_sha\": \"...\",\n  \"generated_at\": \"...\",\n  \"live_remote_main_at_generation\": \"...\",\n  \"fresh_at_generation\": true\n}\n```\n\n展示时：\n\n```text\nsubject_sha != live main\n```\n\n就必须：\n\n```text\nSTALE_PROJECTION\n```\n\n不能叫“current truth”。\n\n### Commit 模板\n\n每一个 PR 建议使用：\n\n```text\n<scope>: <imperative summary>\n\nProblem:\n- ...\n\nInvariant:\n- INV-...\n\nChange:\n- ...\n\nTests:\n- ...\n\nCI:\n- ...\n\nEvidence:\n- before: E?\n- after: E?\n\nRollback:\n- ...\n\nAuthority impact:\n- none | updated <path>\n\nSubject SHA:\n- ...\n```\n\n示例：\n\n```text\ndesign-layer: enforce single chosen direction\n\nProblem:\n- multiple chosen directions could coexist.\n\nInvariant:\n- INV-DL-001: one Brief has at most one active chosen Direction.\n\nChange:\n- atomically clear previous choice and choose the requested Direction.\n\nTests:\n- A -> B transition\n- replay B\n- project isolation\n- SQLite final-state assertion\n\nCI:\n- Python integration gate\n\nEvidence:\n- E1 structural correctness\n\nRollback:\n- revert this commit and schema migration as one unit\n\nAuthority impact:\n- none\n```\n\n### 必须执行的测试矩阵\n\n最低必须新增/保持：\n\n```text\ntest_single_choice_invariant\ntest_choice_switch_atomic\ntest_choice_replay_idempotent\ntest_no_choice_returns_null\ntest_bind_unchosen_rejected_without_mutation\ntest_constraints_nonempty_string_roundtrip\ntest_reference_missing_rejected\ntest_reference_cross_project_rejected\ntest_reference_duplicate_handling\ntest_reference_valid_roundtrip\ntest_unknown_design_system_rejected\ntest_binding_replay_idempotent\ntest_project_state_isolation\ntest_brief_revision_lineage\ntest_direction_revision_lineage\ntest_binding_supersession_lineage\ntest_catalog_available_from_installed_wheel\ntest_e_slice_from_installed_wheel\ntest_browser_e2e_cannot_skip_in_ci\ntest_browser_reference_to_binding\ntest_browser_reload_persistence\ntest_evidence_requalification_lowers_effective_floor\ntest_stale_projection_detected\n```\n\n建议 aggregate：\n\n```bash\npython -m pytest -q\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm --filter workbench typecheck\npnpm --filter workbench test\npnpm --filter workbench build\npnpm e2e:ci\npython -m build --wheel\npython scripts/ci/wheel_smoke.py\npython scripts/verify_authority.py\npython scripts/verify_evidence.py\n```\n\n具体脚本名必须以当前 `main@6c5f68e` 实际仓库为准，不应为了让报告看起来完整而杜撰不存在的命令。\n\n### Gate 状态机\n\n建议以后 PR 都使用这一层级：\n\n```text\nG0 Repository baseline\n        ↓\nG1 Static / contracts / authority\n        ↓\nG2 Python state invariants\n        ↓\nG3 TypeScript / Workbench\n        ↓\nG4 installed-wheel smoke\n        ↓\nG5 exact-SHA browser E2\n        ↓\nG6 real Host E3\n        ↓\nG7 Human Jury E4\n        ↓\nG8 Release E5\n```\n\nHost 不在线时：\n\n```text\nG6 = NOT_RUN\n```\n\n不是：\n\n```text\nG6 = PASS\n```\n\n也不是把 historical E3 当 current E3。\n\n## 最终验收、剩余阻塞与产品结论\n\n### P0 必须全部关闭后才能继续大规模软件集成\n\n当前成熟路线最重要的是控制范围。\n\n**第一阶段验收：**\n\n```text\nDirection invariant correct\nchosen_direction semantically correct\nbind-before-choice impossible\nconstraints contract stable\nReference real and ownership-safe\nDesignSystem binding correct\ninstalled wheel self-contained\nexact-SHA browser E2 mandatory\nAuthority/policy/report no drift\nrequalification enforced\n```\n\n这时才能写：\n\n```text\nPRODUCT_VERTICAL_SLICE_E2\n```\n\n### Photoshop E3 的验收不是“能点击 Photoshop”\n\n它至少应形成：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"subject_sha\": \"...\",\n  \"adapter\": \"photoshop\",\n  \"provider\": \"native|uxp|jsx|...\",\n  \"host_version\": \"...\",\n  \"operation_intent_id\": \"...\",\n  \"input_design_revision\": \"...\",\n  \"document_identity\": \"...\",\n  \"artifact\": \"...\",\n  \"readback\": {\n    \"layers\": [],\n    \"dimensions\": null\n  },\n  \"success\": true\n}\n```\n\n并验证一个真实任务：\n\n```text\nopen/create editable document\n→ create/edit named layer\n→ apply defined design operation\n→ save editable artifact\n→ read back object/layer state\n→ compare against expected state\n→ perform patch\n→ read back again\n```\n\n否则仍然只是：\n\n```text\ncomputer-use demonstration\n```\n\n不是：\n\n```text\nREAL_HOST_WORKFLOW_E3\n```\n\n### MiniMax 的准入 Gate\n\nMiniMax 只有满足以下清单才应该成为正式 Provider：\n\n| Gate | 要求 |\n|---|---|\n| Provenance | 产品/SDK/版本明确 |\n| Interface | 可重复调用的接口明确 |\n| License | 自动化/商业使用合法 |\n| Authentication | credential boundary 明确 |\n| Determinism | 请求与执行可以关联 |\n| Readback | 不只“看起来做完” |\n| Artifact | 可定位输出 |\n| Failure | 可以识别失败 |\n| Timeout | 可控 |\n| Retry | 幂等或有 compensating semantics |\n| Version | provider version 可记录 |\n| Evidence | receipt 能进入 DESIGN-LAB evidence |\n| Isolation | 不拥有 canonical DB |\n| Fallback | provider 不可用时核心产品仍可运行 |\n\n如果只有：\n\n```text\n“我给 MiniMax 一个 prompt，它自己点 PS”\n```\n\n它非常适合实验和 operator acceleration，但不适合成为 canonical execution substrate。\n\n### 仍未解决的高价值问题\n\n由于本轮最终化前没有完成第二轮外部资料与当前 SHA 的全部展开，以下事项应视为**明确待核验**，而不是报告中的隐藏假设：\n\n1. `main@6c5f68e` 是否已经修复了上一基线发现的 Direction、constraints、Reference、packaging 等问题。\n2. `6c5f68e` 的精确文件/目录总数。\n3. 当前时点 open PR、Issue、Release 数。\n4. 当前 `main` 最新 Canonical Actions run ID 及 exact test/skip/fail。\n5. 当前所有远端分支相对 `6c5f68e` 的 merged/ahead/diverged 分类。\n6. MiniMax Design 的 Photoshop 控制机制到底是官方插件、JSX/ExtendScript、CEP/UXP、桌面 UI/computer-use，还是私有桥接协议。\n7. 仓库当前是否已经包含 MiniMax 可执行 adapter/client，而不仅是软件调研或配置。\n8. 当前 Adobe adapter 哪些真正拥有 exact-current-tree E3，哪些只是历史证据。\n9. GitHub branch protection/administration 类信息如仍受 token 权限限制，需要仓库 administration/read-org 级权限才能完整核验。\n\n这些都应该由 `BASELINE-001` 和 `MM-001` 明确产出机器可读结果，**不能再依靠聊天上下文记忆。**\n\n### 成熟方案的真正主线\n\nDESIGN-LAB 后续不应该再按：\n\n```text\n发现一个软件\n→ 找一个自动化工具\n→ 写一套特殊逻辑\n→ 再发现一个软件\n→ 再写一套特殊逻辑\n```\n\n推进。\n\n应该变成：\n\n```text\nCanonical Product State\n        ↓\nCanonical Design Operation\n        ↓\nCapability Router\n        ↓\nHost Adapter\n        ↓\nExecution Receipt\n        ↓\nReadback\n        ↓\nCanonical State\n        ↓\nEvidence\n```\n\n然后：\n\n```text\nPhotoshop native\nIllustrator native\nMiniMax external provider\nWindows UIA\nVision computer-use\n```\n\n只是可替换 Provider。\n\n这样一来，之前调研的所有软件控制方式都不会浪费；它们会从“互相竞争的路线”变成“一个统一 Adapter 架构下的能力库存”。\n\n**最终建议优先级是：**\n\n> **状态正确性 > Reference 真闭环 > 安装态真值 > exact-SHA Browser E2 > Host Adapter Contract > Photoshop E3 > Illustrator E3 > MiniMax Provider Qualification > 其他软件 > Human E4 > Release E5。**\n\n在这个顺序下，MiniMax Design 不再是“要不要推翻现有方案”的问题，而是：\n\n> **它如果确实能高质量控制 Photoshop，就把它接进同一个 Host Adapter Contract，和 native Photoshop adapter 做相同任务、相同 readback、相同 Evidence 的对比。谁更可靠，就让 Router 在合适场景选谁。**\n\n这比把整个 DESIGN-LAB 架到 MiniMax 之上成熟得多，也保留了你此前调研 Adobe、JSX、宿主脚本、UI Automation 和开源方案的全部价值。\n\n**本轮保守最终产品状态：**\n\n```text\nCONTROLLED_RUNTIME_READY\n```\n\n升级条件严格为：\n\n```text\nP0 state invariants\n+ real Reference\n+ isolated wheel\n+ exact-SHA Chromium no-skip\n+ triple readback\n= PRODUCT_VERTICAL_SLICE_E2\n```\n\n再进一步：\n\n```text\nreal Photoshop\n+ editable artifact\n+ structured readback\n+ exact provider/version/SHA provenance\n+ failure/recovery evidence\n= REAL_HOST_WORKFLOW_E3\n```\n\n之后：\n\n```text\nindependent human acceptance\n= HUMAN_ACCEPTED_E4\n```\n\n最后：\n\n```text\nclean install\n+ release artifact\n+ repeatable deployment\n+ release evidence\n= RELEASED_E5\n```\n\n**这应当成为 DESIGN-LAB 后续唯一的成熟化主任务链。**"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"content_references":[{"matched_text":" ","prefix":null,"start_idx":36505,"end_idx":36505,"safe_urls":[],"refs":[],"alt":"","prompt_text":null,"type":"sources_footnote","sources":[],"has_images":false}],"story_events":[],"citations":[],"resolved_model_slug":"gpt-5-thinking","gizmo_id":"g-p-6aa0fe853a748191ad8fe14b747ef04c","cot_version":"v5","venus_message":true},"recipient":"all","channel":"final"}},"activity_messages":[{"id":"a00b813b-01d9-4414-8bc7-eee045082201","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789821622.206714,"update_time":1789821627.811353,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"已停止思考"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_cancelled"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"c80d739f-6cfe-4e62-b516-e8cef1263777","author":{"role":"tool","name":"GitHub.fetch","metadata":{}},"create_time":1789955782.9526873,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":[]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Fetching Main Branch Repository Details","invoked_resource":{"resource_uri":"/connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157/link_6a2aaf39b9948191b8aafcdc287530c7/fetch"},"citation_metadata":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/branches/main","title":"main"}],"retrieval_citations_metadata":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/branches/main","title":"main"}]},"recipient":"all","channel":"commentary"},{"id":"85836dc5-dd58-4500-8e66-29f9cfaa60d4","author":{"role":"tool","name":"GitHub.fetch","metadata":{}},"create_time":1789955786.5333545,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":[]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Counting Files in Recursive Git Tree","invoked_resource":{"resource_uri":"/connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157/link_6a2aaf39b9948191b8aafcdc287530c7/fetch"},"citation_metadata":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/git/trees/6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21?recursive=1","title":"6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21"}],"retrieval_citations_metadata":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/git/trees/6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21?recursive=1","title":"6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21"}]},"recipient":"all","channel":"commentary"},{"id":"efc2203b-4c69-42fc-b36e-b32acc0e9680","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789955794.001543,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"thoughts","thoughts":[{"summary":"Planning repository analysis","content":"I’m trying to obtain reliable file counts from a large repository response, but the available result is unwieldy to inspect directly. A better approach may be to retrieve the public repository locally, then calculate the counts and run any needed checks there. That should be more practical than manually parsing a huge, single-line response, assuming network access is available.","chunks":[],"finished":true},{"summary":"Planned repository analysis","content":"","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"5b83f21c-6f12-4973-ad22-2cd854fadcff"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"245fa37e-6f83-43a8-9f00-6b5106dd88f4","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789956069.104032,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"Worked for 4m 53s"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_ended"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"7185ec68-547e-5687-8db0-f82c29c64052","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":null,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":""},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":0.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Generated report on DESIGN-LAB 全量再审计与后续成熟方案任务包"},"recipient":"all","channel":null}],"source_searches":[{"key":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/branches/main","domain":"api.github.com","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/branches/main","titles":[{"key":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/branches/main-main","title":"main","items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/branches/main","domain":"api.github.com","title":"main","cloud_doc_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/branches/main"}]}]},{"key":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/git/trees/6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21?recursive=1","domain":"api.github.com","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/DESIGN-LAB/git/trees/6c5f68ebdcac7587f85df155088b01d40e093b21?recursive=1","titles"